  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency seed distribution to conflict-affected smallholder farmers in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mitigate the immediate impacts of the war on agricultural production, the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO) will provide spring seed support to approximately 
455 smallholder farmers in conflict-affected areas  to enable them to sustain their livelihoods and protect and recover agricultural value chains disrupted by the war. Depending on access, activities under this intervention will be implemented in Kharkivska oblast.</narrative>
  </description>
